# KeyStone live-data feed keys (Prompt 13). Copy wanted lines into .env at
# the repo root. EVERY key is optional — the platform is keyless by default:
# a missing key parks that one feed as UNCONFIGURED in the feed health panel
# and everything else runs. Keys are read server-side only; nothing here is
# ever shipped to the browser.

# --- 511NY (roadway incidents, roadwork, TRANSCOM regional events, cameras)
# Free developer key; requires accepting the Developer Access Agreement.
# Sign up: https://511ny.org/developers/register
# Hard limit honored by the scheduler: 10 calls / 60 seconds.
#NY511_API_KEY=

# --- AirNow (current AQI observations + forecasts by zip)
# Free key. Sign up: https://docs.airnowapi.org/account/request/
#AIRNOW_API_KEY=

# --- Socrata app token (NYC Open Data + data.ny.gov)
# Optional — raises rate limits for 311, building-intel, FloodNet-site and
# subway-station lookups; feeds work without it at the anonymous tier.
# Sign up: https://data.cityofnewyork.us/profile/edit/developer_settings
#SOCRATA_APP_TOKEN=

# --- FloodNet NYC (live per-minute street flood depths)
# Phase 2 only: live readings activate once FloodNet approves the data
# request (this build generates ready-to-send request text; sensor SITES
# render keyless from NYC Open Data kb2e-tjy3 either way).
# Request form: https://www.floodnet.nyc/  (Contact / data request)
#FLOODNET_API_KEY=

# No signup needed (fully keyless): MTA GTFS-Realtime, NOAA CO-OPS/PORTS,
# USGS Instantaneous Values, NYC DOT cameras, OpenFEMA, HIFLD Open,
# NYS orthoimagery.
